\# GCE AI Rules

\#\# Purpose

This rule governs every AI-powered feature across the GCE platform.

Whenever creating or modifying:

\- AI Lead Assist
\- Recommendation Engine
\- Matching Engine
\- Lead Distribution
\- AI Search
\- AI Automation
\- AI Notifications
\- AI Scoring
\- AI Analytics

always follow the official AI documentation before writing code.

\---

\# Documentation Priority

Always consult the following documentation before implementing AI functionality.

\#\# AI Lead Assist / Lead Intelligence

\`\`\`
docs/founder-decisions/FD-031_GCE_Connect_AI_Lead_Assist_Architecture.md
39\_AI\_Lead\_Assist\_Spec.md
10\_AI\_Lead\_Assist.md
36\_Commercial\_Constants.md
\`\`\`

Defines:

\- Central GCE Lead Intelligence Engine
\- GCE Lead Intelligence and Opportunity Desk
\- Core Lead Rights
\- Quality states and Circle-first routing
\- Human oversight and monetisation principles

Lead Assist is a **separate service** from base GCE Connect Circle Membership. Do **not** treat FD-027 membership commercial rules as approving Lead Assist fee, escrow, deficit-reward, credit voucher, forfeiture, blocking, or Lead Assist commission. Do **not** implement historical ₹500 / Rainmaker-only / Pass Lead / subscription-credit narratives as active Stage-1 rules. Exact prices, escrow, forfeiture, voucher/credit, success fee, and Lead Assist commission remain **Unresolved** under FD-031 — do not invent.

**Human-control hard bans:** AI must not independently award projects, transfer money, approve refunds/settlement, suspend/terminate membership, permanently alter Trust Rank, grant/deny Core Tier, or decide serious disputes.

For Circle-related AI features (matching, referral routing, attendance insights), respect FD-030 / `38_Circle_Architecture.md`: Protected Tag Scope, one primary Specialization, platform-recorded referrals, Dual-Confirmed Closed Business, and no guaranteed business outcomes. Do not invent workshop commission or voting rules.

